 388  4493              ; move: a frame of the game: the scroll a pixel on, the level round, and each
 389  4493              ; ball a step, back off the sky's edges. Unrolled: each ball's X and Y are
 390  4493              ; where sprites sends them from, in the copy of the attributes, and its DX and
